{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_05B2E0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Cécile，你说过录音时会用一种什么设备吧。那个，卡带……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"卡带Densuke？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":16,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"对，就是那个。那到底是什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"是日本一家叫Sony的公司去年推出的<R=便携式,PORTABLE>录音机。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=便携式,PORTABLE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"因为使用紧凑型卡带，比以前的开盘式录音机轻多了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"不过还是有5公斤左右，带着到处走正好减肥！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":61,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"哦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"用起来也很方便。所有按键都有凸起，不看手边也能操作。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"要是稍微移开视线就跟丢了珍稀鸟类，那可后悔都来不及。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"确实。不过为什么叫这个名字？听起来简直像日本人的名字……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"这个我来解释。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"Kaz！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"Densuke是<R=便携式,PORTABLE>录音机的俗称。听说来源于一部漫画的主人公名字。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=便携式,PORTABLE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"那家伙也是个录音迷？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"别说得那么难听。现场录音可是很棒的！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"把充满现场感的声音亲手记录下来，太棒了！就像不用取景器，而是用声音截取眼前的景象。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"闭上眼睛听录音带，景象就会鲜明地浮现在眼前……对吧，Cécile！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"当然，宝贝。在<R= 房间 ,APPARTEMENT>里听着鸟鸣，就会有种自己正置身幽深森林的感觉。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R= 房间 ,APPARTEMENT>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"不愧是巴黎姑娘，懂什么叫情调。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"……情调，是吗……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"Miller先生会录什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"我？那当然是<R=蒸汽机车,SL>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=蒸汽机车,SL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":40,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"强劲的排气声、浑厚的汽笛……那与其说是机器，不如说是野兽的咆哮。唔——真让人受不了！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"日本的SL正在一辆接一辆地退役。可以的话，我真想哪怕只回国一小段时间，也把它们录下来……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":131,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"咦——……没想到Miller先生还挺野蛮的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"野、野蛮！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"Miller先生，我最喜……说错了，我讨厌SL。发出那么大的声音，森林里的鸟都会被吓到吧。还有烟……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":137,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"我还是想静静听森林里的声音。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"啊……不，等等，Cécile，先等一下。我不是那个意思……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"……真是的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""}]}